blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">全线奏凯！英超球队欧冠/欧联首轮8战全胜，进19球仅丢4球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/202609180520531502.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/202609180520531502_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/202609180520531502_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠、欧联赛场的首轮比赛都已结束，英超出战的8支球队都取得胜利，共打进19球，丢4球。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-18/6aac3f7f7dff1native.htm#pl_box" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩专访全文：加盟皇马无需理由 会努力带回金球 穆帅与众不同</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/202609180330076314_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/202609180330076314_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260918/202609180330076314_720.jpg"> </div><p>姆巴佩接受《阿斯报》专访，谈到了加盟皇马、世界杯、金球奖、与巴萨争冠等话题。</p><p><a href=