况。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-18/6aac2091b147anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">凯恩：金球奖全靠评委投票和大家选，我能成为竞争者已经很开心了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260918/202609180119195184.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260918/202609180119195184.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260918/202609180119195184.jpg"> </div><p>凯恩参加TNT体育节目，主持人给出了一些留言，凯恩一一回复。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-18/6aac242db1193native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">沙特媒：亚冠0-4惨败艾因，波斯特科格鲁给利雅得胜利全队放假5天</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250918/68cb66e50ecb9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250918/68cb66e50ecb9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250918/68cb66e50ecb9.jpg"> </div><p>据沙特媒体报道，利雅得胜利主帅波斯特科格鲁在球队亚冠0-4惨败艾因后，给